<title>USA: Bear Stearns sets $150 mln in snr notes.</title>
<headline>Bear Stearns sets $150 mln in snr notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue was</p>
<p>priced on Tuesday, said lead manager Bear Stearns &amp; Co Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER BEAR STEARNS COS INC</p>
<p>AMT $150 MLN	 COUPON 7.25 PCT   MATURITY 10/15/2006</p>
<p>TYPE SNR NOTES     ISS PRICE 100.00  PAY DATE 04/15/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY A2	SPREAD +73 BP/WI  PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-A  YIELD 7.25 PCT    CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>--Corporate bond unit 212-859-1678</p>
</text>
